<title>USA: Reynolds Metals unit sells business.</title>
<headline>Reynolds Metals unit sells business.</headline>
<dateline>APLLETON, Wis. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Presto Products Co, a unit of Reynolds Metals Co, said Monday it has signed a letter of intent to sell its moist towelette business to Rockline Industries Inc, a privately held company.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed, but the transaction is not expected to have a material effect on Reynolds results, Presto said.</p>
<p>Closing is expected in the third quarter, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
